  <link href="/logo.png" rel="icon" type="image/png"/>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="nav-wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <img alt="Shree Gajanand India logo" src="logo.png"/>
        <span class="brand-text">
          <strong>SHREE GAJANAND INDIA</strong>
          <span>Pan-India Workforce, Facility &amp; Infrastructure Solutions</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="navbar" id="mainNav">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="./index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="./about.html">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a class="active" href="./services.html">Our Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="./gallery.html">Gallery</a></li>
          <li><a href="./client.html">Industries</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-cta" href="./contact.html">Contact Us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <button aria-controls="mainNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle menu" class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <h1>Our Services</h1>
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="./index.html">Home</a> / Our Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="services-intro-section">
    <div class="services-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">What We Offer</div>
      <h2>Pan-India Multi-Sector Service Solutions</h2>
      <p>We provide reliable workforce, facility, infrastructure, industrial and operational support services, planned around each client’s site and project requirements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-showcase">
    <div class="service-showcase-card">
      <div class="service-number">01</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Manpower &amp; Workforce Solutions</h2>
          <p>Skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled personnel deployed according to the operational needs of government, industrial, commercial and infrastructure projects.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Trained workforce deployment</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Attendance and shift management</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Regular on-site supervision</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-showcase-card service-reverse">
      <div class="service-number">02</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-broom"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Housekeeping &amp; Facility Management</h2>
          <p>Organised housekeeping, cleaning, sanitation and facility-support services for offices, stations, workshops, institutions and commercial premises.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Commercial and institutional housekeeping</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Cleaning and sanitation schedules</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Quality monitoring and supervision</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-showcase-card">
      <div class="service-number">03</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-train-subway"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Railway &amp; Transportation Services</h2>
          <p>Railway and transport-support work delivered with careful planning, manpower coordination, safety awareness and a focus on timely execution.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Railway project support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Station, workshop and yard support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Transportation and logistics workforce</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-showcase-card service-reverse">
      <div class="service-number">04</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-helmet-safety"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Construction &amp; Infrastructure Services</h2>
          <p>Project-support services for civil work, repair, renovation, maintenance and infrastructure operations, aligned to the scope of work.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Civil and site-support workforce</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Repair and maintenance support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Project coordination and supervision</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-showcase-card">
      <div class="service-number">05</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-industry"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Industrial &amp; Logistics Services</h2>
          <p>Flexible operational support for plants, warehouses and supply-chain sites through reliable manpower and day-to-day site coordination.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Industrial and production support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Material handling and loading support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Warehouse operations workforce</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-showcase-card service-reverse">
      <div class="service-number">06</div>
      <div class="service-showcase-content">
        <div class="service-icon-large"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
        <div>
          <span class="service-label">OUR SERVICE</span>
          <h2>Security &amp; Support Services</h2>
          <p>Site-support staffing, gate-management assistance and supervisory support designed around the operational needs of each client location.</p>
          <div class="service-points">
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Gate-management support</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Access-control assistance</div>
            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>Site supervision support</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="inner-section industries-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Industries We Serve</div>
      <h2>Support for Projects Across Sectors</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Railway is one of the sectors we serve. Our services are designed for projects and operations across India.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="client-category-grid">
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"></i></div><h3>Government Projects</h3><p>Requirement-based manpower, facility and project support services.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-train"></i></div><h3>Railway &amp; Transportation</h3><p>Operational, workforce and facility support for transport-related sites.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-helmet-safety"></i></div><h3>Construction &amp; Infrastructure</h3><p>Site-support workforce and coordination for project execution.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-industry"></i></div><h3>Manufacturing &amp; Industrial</h3><p>Operational manpower and support for plant and industrial sites.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-warehouse"></i></div><h3>Warehousing &amp; Logistics</h3><p>Material-handling and workforce support for warehouse operations.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i></div><h3>Commercial &amp; Institutional</h3><p>Facility, housekeeping and operational support for organised premises.</p></div>
      <div class="client-category-card"><div class="client-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i></div><h3>Private Enterprises</h3><p>Flexible service solutions for businesses across a range of sectors.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-process-section">
    <div class="process-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">How We Work</div>
      <h2>A Simple Process From Requirement to Execution</h2>
      <p>We follow a clear and organised approach for every project.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="modern-process-grid">
      <div class="modern-process-card"><div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i></div><span>01</span><h3>Requirement</h3><p>We understand your scope of work, location, timeline and service requirements before proposing a solution.</p></div>
      <div class="modern-process-card"><div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i></div><span>02</span><h3>Planning</h3><p>We plan the manpower, supervision and site-support requirements for organised execution.</p></div>
      <div class="modern-process-card"><div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i></div><span>03</span><h3>Deployment</h3><p>Our team coordinates workforce and site resources according to the agreed project plan.</p></div>
      <div class="modern-process-card"><div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div><span>04</span><h3>Execution</h3><p>We monitor work, maintain communication and focus on quality, discipline and timely delivery.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <h2>Have a project or service requirement?</h2>
    <p>Send us your details and we will respond with a tailored proposal.</p>
    <a class="cta-btn" href="contact.html">Request a Quote</a>
  </section>
